//#region - After Supply Chain 

::AfterSupplyChainCh1
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene
@once

{@PAL}      The conductor materials just arrived. Quinn is so efficient for a human. 
{@PAL} 		Are you ready to work with our incredible new automation unit? You will have to keep up!
{@Player}   Um... I think so. I used to work with Arkan at the Fab, so I know what to expect. 
{@PAL}     	OOOh, this will be much faster than your human teammate. 
{@Player}  	We'll see...

//pickup tone
//{@Ovill}    We have a super duper exclusive deal just for you! 
//{@Player}   What?
//{@Ovill}    If you source with us today, and we'll throw in a complimentary Frontier Robotics swag bag! 
//{@Ovill}    All you need to do is source with us within the next 24 hours-
//{@Player}   I already sourced materials with Kalvis...I needed Copper so...
//{@Ovill}    Oh-... was my pitch bad?
//{@Ovill}    Maybe if I raise my voice and bring more "pazaaz". Let me start over.
//{@Ovill}    LOCKE, DO I HAVE A DEAL FOR YOU, IF YOU SOURCE WITH US TODAY- 
//{@Player}   I'M NOT INTERESTED!
//{@Player}   Not because you did a bad pitch. Just... bad timing. Sorry.
//{@Ovill}    So... it wasn't my fault? 
//{@Player}   Yes. I guess. 
//{@Ovill}    Fantastic!  I can put that in my daily report. Perfect marks.  
//{@Ovill}    Anyways. I'm Ovill. 
//{@Ovill}    Just holo if you would like to business with the Forsch sector!
//{@Player}   Thanks, Ovill. 
//hang-up dial

//#region - Fabrication 
::AfterFabricationCh1
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene
@once

{@PAL}      Congratulations on completing your orientation Captain.
{@Player}   Thanks... I think I am getting the hang of it. 
{@PAL}      Positive.Affirmation.exe! 
{@Player}   Back atcha bro. 
{@PAL}      ...my name is P.A.L, not bro.
{@Player} 	Right...
{@PAL} 	    Now submit your contract and Frontier will transfer payment into your account. 

//endregion 
